# Build artifacts
**/bin/
**/dist/
**/coverage.out
**/*.test

# Editor / OS
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/

# Git internals
.git/
**/.gitignore

# CI metadata not needed in build context
.github/

# Documentation
**/README.md
**/CHANGELOG.md
**/CONTRIBUTING.md
**/SECURITY.md

# Tests + benchmarks (built when running tests, not deployed)
**/testdata/
**/*_test.go
tests/

# Dotenv files: never bake secrets into the image
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*

# Runtime image needs exactly one build artifact: the compiled server binary at
# bin/lyeve (see the Dockerfile for how a clone builds it). Re-include it, and
# only it, from bin/.
!bin
bin/*
!bin/lyeve
